    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ProcW is a 2-Player Local Multiplayer game. At the end of every round, the loser's weapon stats get changed randomly, whilst the winner gets points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently has the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Local PVP Mode (1 Keyboard &amp; Mouse, 1 Controller)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Impacting Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly changing weapon stats at the end of each round, allowing infinite replayability.</p></li></ul>",
